  "slug": "kth-missing-positive-number",
  "title": "第 K 个缺失的正整数",
  "status": "published",
  "qualityGate": "tested",
  "batch": "batch-022",
  "studyTags": [
    "数组",
    "二分查找"
  ],
  "summary": "严格递增正整数数组中，返回未出现的第 k 个正整数。",
  "insight": "到下标 i 为止缺失数为 arr[i]-i-1。二分首个缺失数不少于 k 的位置 left，答案统一为 left+k。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "缺失序列从正整数一开始",
    "答案可能在数组末尾之后",
    "二分位置可等于数组长度"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "missing-count-binary-search",
      "title": "缺失计数二分",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "按每个数组位置之前累计缺失数量寻找边界。",
      "steps": [
        "left=0,right=n",
        "middle 缺失数 arr[middle]-middle-1<k 时 left=middle+1，否则 right=middle",
        "返回 left+k"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(log n)",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/missing-count-binary-search/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/missing-count-binary-search/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/missing-count-binary-search/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
